TIP:  If transposing, play the root chord of the transposed (Gadd) and add the 5th note as needed.

TIP:  There are a few uncommon chords here.  (Fmaj7) is just (F) without the 1st string.  (Cmaj7) is just (C) without the index finger on the 1st fret.  To play the (Fmaj7) (Cmaj7) sequence all you do is lift up one string set and don't play the index finger.  Strum once for each chord.
 
       
